{"source": "tts:kokoro:af_heart", "precision": "tts", "offset": 0, "duration": 91.132, "sentences": [{"text": "Every answer the twin gives has a price, and you can watch it.", "start": 0, "end": 3.194}, {"text": "In the room, a neon sign shows what each call cost, to the millionth of a dollar.", "start": 3.444, "end": 8.086}, {"text": "It reads the gateway's own reply, not a dashboard.", "start": 8.336, "end": 11.157}, {"text": "Every model call goes through the gateway, and every call carries four things: the provider, the model, the tokens, and the cost.", "start": 11.407, "end": 18.876}, {"text": "Local answers cost nothing.", "start": 19.126, "end": 20.748}, {"text": "The paid fallback is Claude Haiku: ten cents per million tokens in, fifty cents out.", "start": 20.997, "end": 26.152}, {"text": "Why Haiku?", "start": 26.402, "end": 27.198}, {"text": "In Hareet's words: \"we chose haiku since our context base is small and manually evaluated haiku and sonnet.\"", "start": 27.448, "end": 34.072}, {"text": "Money is counted in whole micro-dollars, never a float, in the gateway's own database.", "start": 34.322, "end": 39.653}, {"text": "Every call is also traced in Langfuse, which runs inside the stack.", "start": 39.903, "end": 43.941}, {"text": "And it's locked down: no route out, sign-up switched off, its own telemetry off, and no prompts or answers kept, unless sampling is switched on in development.", "start": 44.191, "end": 53.691}, {"text": "Grafana puts spend beside latency and errors: today, this month, and the fallback's own budget.", "start": 53.941, "end": 59.608}, {"text": "Why measure all of it?", "start": 59.858, "end": 60.982}, {"text": "Because the meter is the control.", "start": 61.232, "end": 62.992}, {"text": "Cloud billing alerts lag by hours;", "start": 63.242, "end": 65.276}, {"text": "this one decides in real time.", "start": 65.526, "end": 67.245}, {"text": "A full evaluation run, a hundred and eighty-six cases on Haiku, cost about twenty-one cents.", "start": 67.495, "end": 73.334}, {"text": "A real-time cost meter.", "start": 73.584, "end": 75.034}, {"text": "Built in the open, at hareet dot A I.", "start": 75.284, "end": 77.626}], "words": [{"word": "Every", "start": 0.5, "end": 0.978}, {"word": "answer", "start": 0.978, "end": 1.297}, {"word": "the", "start": 1.297, "end": 1.457}, {"word": "twin", "start": 1.457, "end": 1.616}, {"word": "gives", "start": 1.616, "end": 1.935}, {"word": "has", "start": 1.935, "end": 2.095}, {"word": "a", "start": 2.095, "end": 2.254}, {"word": "price", "start": 2.254, "end": 2.573}, {"word": "and", "start": 2.888, "end": 3.049}, {"word": "you", "start": 3.049, "end": 3.21}, {"word": "can", "start": 3.21, "end": 3.372}, {"word": "watch", "start": 3.372, "end": 3.533}, {"word": "it", "start": 3.533, "end": 3.694}, {"word": "In", "start": 4.74, "end": 4.938}, {"word": "the", "start": 4.938, "end": 5.136}, {"word": "room", "start": 5.136, "end": 5.334}, {"word": "a", "start": 5.526, "end": 5.82}, {"word": "neon", "start": 5.82, "end": 6.113}, {"word": "sign", "start": 6.113, "end": 6.407}, {"word": "shows", "start": 6.407, "end": 6.7}, {"word": "what", "start": 6.7, "end": 6.993}, {"word": "each", "start": 6.993, "end": 7.287}, {"word": "call", "start": 7.287, "end": 7.58}, {"word": "cost", "start": 7.58, "end": 7.873}, {"word": "to", "start": 8.197, "end": 8.346}, {"word": "the", "start": 8.346, "end": 8.494}, {"word": "millionth", "start": 8.494, "end": 8.79}, {"word": "of", "start": 8.79, "end": 8.938}, {"word": "a", "start": 8.938, "end": 9.086}, {"word": "dollar", "start": 9.086, "end": 9.382}, {"word": "It", "start": 9.632, "end": 9.802}, {"word": "reads", "start": 9.802, "end": 9.973}, {"word": "the", "start": 9.973, "end": 10.143}, {"word": "gateway's", "start": 10.143, "end": 10.825}, {"word": "own", "start": 10.825, "end": 10.996}, {"word": "reply", "start": 10.996, "end": 11.337}, {"word": "not", "start": 11.599, "end": 11.812}, {"word": "a", "start": 11.812,